---
import { SITE } from '../lib/constants';
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container-x py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] sm:rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-[4px] sm:border-[6px] border-white">
      <img src="/image5.png" alt={`${SITE.name} Eğitim Merkezi`} class="w-full h-auto object-cover" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/95 via-slate-900/75 to-slate-900/20"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 text-white" style="text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-white/30" style="text-shadow:none;">Bizi Tanıyın</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold max-w-3xl leading-tight text-white">Geleceğinizi bizimle inşa edin — Eğitim & Gelişim Merkezi</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm sm:text-base text-white/95">Modern öğrenme alanları, deneyimli eğitmenler ve sistemli rehberlik anlayışıyla Konya'da güvenilir bir eğitim adresi.</p>
        <div class="mt-5 sm:mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a href="#basvuru" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500 hover:bg-brand-600 transition px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold shadow-soft">Hemen Başvur</a>
          <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsappNumber}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/25 backdrop-blur border border-white/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">WhatsApp'tan Yazın</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
